  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (amending G.L. c. 6A, section 18 3/4, paragraph (10)): to develop or solicit proposals for a university or nonprofit to develop a biennial report analyzing the firearms trace data collected under section 131Q of chapter 140 of the General Laws and non-identifying gun sales transaction data held by the firearms records bureau."
